    <title>关于 Multisim</title>
    <link href="/Multisim/"/>
    <url>/Multisim/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Multisim 神了。打开之后提示无法打开 Master Database。</p><h3 id="数据库文件"><a href="#数据库文件" class="headerlink" title="数据库文件"></a>数据库文件</h3><p>Multisim 的数据库文件在：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">%ProgramData%\National Instruments\Circuit Design Suite\<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>检查发现这个玩意是没有损坏的，但是它打不开。删除 <code>config</code> 然后重新注册 <code>dao360.dll</code> 实测有概率打得开。</p><h3 id="解决方法"><a href="#解决方法" class="headerlink" title="解决方法"></a>解决方法</h3><figure class="highlight bat"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br><span class="line">56</span><br><span class="line">57</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bat">@<span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> off<br><span class="hljs-built_in">setlocal</span> enabledelayedexpansion<br><br>:: <span class="hljs-number">1</span>. Request Administrator Privileges<br>&gt;<span class="hljs-built_in">nul</span> <span class="hljs-number">2</span>&gt;&amp;<span class="hljs-number">1</span> &quot;<span class="hljs-variable">%SYSTEMROOT%</span>\system32\<span class="hljs-built_in">cacls</span>.exe&quot; &quot;<span class="hljs-variable">%SYSTEMROOT%</span>\system32\config\system&quot;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> &#x27;<span class="hljs-variable">%errorlevel%</span>&#x27; <span class="hljs-keyword">NEQ</span> &#x27;<span class="hljs-number">0</span>&#x27; (<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">Set</span> UAC = CreateObject^(&quot;Shell.Application&quot;^) &gt; &quot;<span class="hljs-variable">%temp%</span>\getadmin.vbs&quot;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> UAC.ShellExecute &quot;%~s0&quot;, &quot;&quot;, &quot;&quot;, &quot;runas&quot;, <span class="hljs-number">1</span> &gt;&gt; &quot;<span class="hljs-variable">%temp%</span>\getadmin.vbs&quot;<br>    &quot;<span class="hljs-variable">%temp%</span>\getadmin.vbs&quot;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">exit</span> /B<br>)<br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">exist</span> &quot;<span class="hljs-variable">%temp%</span>\getadmin.vbs&quot; <span class="hljs-built_in">del</span> &quot;<span class="hljs-variable">%temp%</span>\getadmin.vbs&quot;<br><span class="hljs-built_in">cd</span> /d &quot;%~dp0&quot;<br><br><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> [<span class="hljs-number">1</span>/<span class="hljs-number">4</span>] Killing running processes and stopping services...<br><span class="hljs-built_in">taskkill</span> /F /IM multisim.exe &gt;<span class="hljs-built_in">nul</span> <span class="hljs-number">2</span>&gt;&amp;<span class="hljs-number">1</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">taskkill</span> /F /IM ultiboard.exe &gt;<span class="hljs-built_in">nul</span> <span class="hljs-number">2</span>&gt;&amp;<span class="hljs-number">1</span><br><span class="hljs-built_in">net</span> stop &quot;National Instruments Device Service&quot; &gt;<span class="hljs-built_in">nul</span> <span class="hljs-number">2</span>&gt;&amp;<span class="hljs-number">1</span><br>timeout /t <span class="hljs-number">1</span> /nobreak &gt;<span class="hljs-built_in">nul</span><br><br><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> [<span class="hljs-number">2</span>/<span class="hljs-number">4</span>] Clearing user configuration cache...<br><span class="hljs-built_in">set</span> &quot;<span class="hljs-built_in">VER</span>=<span class="hljs-number">14</span>.<span class="hljs-number">3</span>&quot;<br><span class="hljs-built_in">set</span> &quot;USER_CONF=<span class="hljs-variable">%AppData%</span>\National Instruments\Circuit Design Suite\<span class="hljs-variable">%VER%</span>\config&quot;<br><span class="hljs-built_in">set</span> &quot;LOCAL_DATA=<span class="hljs-variable">%LocalAppData%</span>\National Instruments\Circuit Design Suite\<span class="hljs-variable">%VER%</span>&quot;<br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">exist</span> &quot;<span class="hljs-variable">%USER_CONF%</span>&quot; <span class="hljs-built_in">rd</span> /s /q &quot;<span class="hljs-variable">%USER_CONF%</span>&quot;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">exist</span> &quot;<span class="hljs-variable">%LOCAL_DATA%</span>&quot; <span class="hljs-built_in">rd</span> /s /q &quot;<span class="hljs-variable">%LOCAL_DATA%</span>&quot;<br><br><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> [<span class="hljs-number">3</span>/<span class="hljs-number">4</span>] Resetting database file permissions and attributes...<br><span class="hljs-built_in">set</span> &quot;DB_PATH=<span class="hljs-variable">%ProgramData%</span>\National Instruments\Circuit Design Suite\<span class="hljs-variable">%VER%</span>\database&quot;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">exist</span> &quot;<span class="hljs-variable">%DB_PATH%</span>&quot; (<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">attrib</span> -r -s -h &quot;<span class="hljs-variable">%DB_PATH%</span>\*.*&quot; /s /d &gt;<span class="hljs-built_in">nul</span> <span class="hljs-number">2</span>&gt;&amp;<span class="hljs-number">1</span><br>)<br><br><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> [<span class="hljs-number">4</span>/<span class="hljs-number">4</span>] Re-registering COM database engines (DAO / Jet)...<br>:: Register <span class="hljs-number">32</span>-bit DAO engine<br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">exist</span> &quot;<span class="hljs-variable">%CommonProgramFiles(x86)%</span>\Microsoft Shared\DAO\dao360.dll&quot; (<br>    regsvr32 /s &quot;<span class="hljs-variable">%CommonProgramFiles(x86)%</span>\Microsoft Shared\DAO\dao360.dll&quot;<br>) <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">exist</span> &quot;<span class="hljs-variable">%CommonProgramFiles%</span>\Microsoft Shared\DAO\dao360.dll&quot; (<br>    regsvr32 /s &quot;<span class="hljs-variable">%CommonProgramFiles%</span>\Microsoft Shared\DAO\dao360.dll&quot;<br>)<br><br>:: Register Jet DLLs<br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">exist</span> &quot;<span class="hljs-variable">%SystemRoot%</span>\SysWOW64\msjet40.dll&quot; (<br>    regsvr32 /s &quot;<span class="hljs-variable">%SystemRoot%</span>\SysWOW64\msjet40.dll&quot;<br>    regsvr32 /s &quot;<span class="hljs-variable">%SystemRoot%</span>\SysWOW64\msjtes40.dll&quot;<br>) <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span> (<br>    regsvr32 /s &quot;<span class="hljs-variable">%SystemRoot%</span>\System32\msjet40.dll&quot;<br>    regsvr32 /s &quot;<span class="hljs-variable">%SystemRoot%</span>\System32\msjtes40.dll&quot;<br>)<br><br><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span>.<br><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> ========================================<br><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> Fix completed! Please try launching Multisim.<br><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">If</span> it still fails, check whether CPCompDev.prz <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> the database folder is <span class="hljs-number">0</span> KB.<br><span class="hljs-built_in">echo</span> ========================================<br><span class="hljs-built_in">pause</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
    
